msgid "Reflective CLI parser for the RunConfig dataclass tree."
msgstr "Reflective CLI parser for the RunConfig dataclass tree."

#: 1c29e1fad9c6429fa3cf76a2baffa5c2 of utils.config.config_parser:3
msgid ""
"jsonargparse derives CLI flags from the schema (types, ``Literal`` "
"choices, list nargs, bool), merges ``--config``/``default_config`` yaml "
"under CLI overrides, and dumps/loads the same shape."
msgstr ""
"jsonargparse derives CLI flags from the schema (types, ``Literal`` "
"choices, list nargs, bool), merges ``--config``/``default_config`` yaml "
"under CLI overrides, and dumps/loads the same shape."

#: 4d57b2d41020468eb220f1874a005da9 of utils.config.config_parser:7
msgid ""
"The model node is polymorphic and lazily discovered across multiple "
"environments, so the model name (``-m`` / ``--experiment.model_name`` / a"
" yaml) is resolved first and selects the concrete :class:`ModelConfig` "
"subclass before the schema is built."
msgstr ""
"The model node is polymorphic and lazily discovered across multiple "
"environments, so the model name (``-m`` / ``--experiment.model_name`` / a"
" yaml) is resolved first and selects the concrete :class:`ModelConfig` "
"subclass before the schema is built."

#: c7b82e23910b458c94ddb7a8d020095a of utils.config.config_parser:12
msgid ""
"``parse_args`` returns a typed :class:`RunConfig` instance. Entry points "
"needing their own nodes (e.g. ``efficiency.py``) use "
"``parse_with_extras``. Entry points that restore an archived run "
"(``evaluate.py``, ``case_analysis.py`` inference) use "
":func:`parse_run_archive`, which seeds the schema from the run's "
"``run_config.yaml`` before reflective CLI overrides apply."
msgstr ""
"``parse_args`` returns a typed :class:`RunConfig` instance. Entry points "
"needing their own nodes (e.g. ``efficiency.py``) use "
"``parse_with_extras``. Entry points that restore an archived run "
"(``evaluate.py``, ``case_analysis.py`` inference) use "
":func:`parse_run_archive`, which seeds the schema from the run's "
"``run_config.yaml`` before reflective CLI overrides apply."

