msgstr "Instantiate a (possibly nested) config dataclass from its Namespace slice."

#: 24039a4ff56e48e3b0dbe8a36edcf858 of utils.config.config_parser.build_node:3
msgid ""
"Scalar fields map straight through; a dataclass-valued field whose slice "
"is still a Namespace recurses. The efficiency node is the repo's first "
"nested config (general + per-stage sub-nodes); RunConfig nodes have only "
"scalar fields, so this is a no-op for them."
msgstr ""
"Scalar fields map straight through; a dataclass-valued field whose slice "
"is still a Namespace recurses. The efficiency node is the repo's first "
"nested config (general + per-stage sub-nodes); RunConfig nodes have only "
"scalar fields, so this is a no-op for them."

